      "content": "but it doesn't feel like i'm holding it together. it feels like the opposite. i look at the math of it all, and the math just says i'm a net loss. if i disappeared, they'd get insurance, the debt would be easier to manage, and she wouldn't have to watch me struggle every single day. doesn't it just make sense that the easiest way to help them is to just... stop being part of the problem?",
